Falsifies `file_allocation_table::allocation::verification::a_release_frees_only_its_own_chain`.

The defect: the release frees a cluster before it looks at the entry, so a chain that runs into a bad or reserved cluster erases the marker that keeps it out of use.

Expected to fail: the harness's `assert!(matches!(before[at], TableEntry::Next(_) | TableEntry::EndOfChain))`.

